{"name":"トレサ","style":"OCTOPATH TRAVELER / TRESSA COLZIONE","family":"sword","height":86,"radius":18,"stats":{"weight":86,"walkSpeed":3.5,"initialDashSpeed":7,"runSpeed":6.8,"airSpeed":5.5,"airAcceleration":0.35,"gravity":0.62,"fullHopVelocity":13.8},"mask":"green>r*1.08&&green>b*1.12","customPreparation":true,"gate":"if(f.characterId==='tressa'&&type==='dash'&&(tressaLeaves(f)<1||TressaRules.objects.some(q=>q.owner===f.id&&q.kind==='helper'&&!q.dead)))return false;","description":"横必殺はリーフを使って剣士と弓兵を雇う。長押しで最大3人。上必殺は風の渦を回って上がり、離すタイミングで接線方向へ飛び出す。通常必殺は風の刃、長押しで置き竜巻。下必殺と通常攻撃の命中でリーフを獲得する。"}
